From: ReadyNAS NG <readynasng@build>
Subject: [PATCH 15/23] platform: padre: add the LEDs and backup button

Ported from the GPL 2.6.17 led_button driver, same interface
(/proc/sys/dev/led, /proc/sys/dev/button, uevent_helper "button" on
press). The 2.6.17 padre_led_handler hooks become padre_led_set() and
padre_led_ata_activity() (asm/padre.h, stubs when the driver is off).
